      "content": "# Test Checklist\n\n## Functionality\n- [ ] FT-1: Sellers can create product listings that include photos, descriptions, prices, and locations.\n\n- [ ] FT-2: Sellers can update the details of existing product information.\n\n- [ ] FT-3: Sellers can update the information of the products they own.\n\n- [ ] FT-4: The shopping cart cannot contain items that have been removed or are no longer available.\n\n- [ ] FT-5: Users can register new accounts\n\n- [ ] FT-6: Buyers can filter and sort products by category, price range, condition, and distance.\n\n- [ ] FT-7: Buyers can search for products using keywords.\n\n- [ ] FT-8: Buyers can add items to their shopping cart\n\n- [ ] FT-9: Buyers can send shopping requests\n\n## Constraint\n- [ ] CS-10: Users cannot log in if they do not have a registered account.\n\n- [ ] CS-11: Accounts that have already been registered cannot be registered again.\n\n- [ ] CS-12: Unable to log in when user account password is incorrect.\n\n- [ ] CS-13: Sellers cannot update other people's product information.\n\n- [ ] CS-14: Users need to fill in the necessary fields to create product information.\n\n- [ ] CS-15: Prices must be non-negative numbers.\n\n## Interaction\n- [ ] IX-16: Creating duplicate accounts provides visual feedback.\n\n- [ ] IX-17: Search results are displayed in real time when users use the search function.\n\n- [ ] IX-18: The filtering results are displayed in real time when the user uses the filtering function.\n\n- [ ] IX-19: Provide visual feedback when users add items to their cart.\n\n## Content\n- [ ] CT-20: All product photos displayed must be related to the used or upgraded products described in the product details."
